{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 10778504616679541947,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Automatic environment activation with `direnv`",
      "source_hash": 6999670617762670439,
      "context_hash": 16939486966818680443,
      "translation": "`direnv`를 이용한 환경 자동 활성화",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T15:16:43.636682Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Instead of manually activating the environment for each project, you can reload a [declarative shell](declarative-reproducible-envs) every time you enter the project's directory or change the `shell.nix` inside it.",
      "source_hash": 1753334560529779157,
      "context_hash": 1944998455900368407,
      "translation": "프로젝트마다 수동으로 환경을 활성화하는 대신, 프로젝트 디렉터리에 진입하거나 그 안의 `shell.nix`가 변경될 때마다 [선언적 셸](declarative-reproducible-envs)을 다시 로드할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "declarative": "선언적"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T15:16:43.636682Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "[Make nix-direnv available](https://github.com/nix-community/nix-direnv)",
      "source_hash": 6770470646786602167,
      "context_hash": 17231739399428551337,
      "translation": "[nix-direnv를 사용 가능하게 만드십시오](https://github.com/nix-community/nix-direnv)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Nix": "Nix"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T15:16:43.636683Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "[Hook it into your shell](https://direnv.net/docs/hook.html)",
      "source_hash": 6481481649432685511,
      "context_hash": 18380299385017611469,
      "translation": "[셸에 훅으로 연결하십시오](https://direnv.net/docs/hook.html)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T15:16:43.636683Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "For example, write a `shell.nix` with the following contents:",
      "source_hash": 3793592618252307562,
      "context_hash": 6344932630489852230,
      "translation": "예를 들어, 다음 내용을 담은 `shell.nix`를 작성하십시오:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T15:16:43.636683Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "From the top-level directory of your project, run:",
      "source_hash": 9926258093588800085,
      "context_hash": 12405357007337854962,
      "translation": "프로젝트의 최상위 디렉터리에서 다음을 실행하십시오:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T15:16:43.636683Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "The next time you launch your terminal and enter the top-level directory of your project, `direnv` will automatically launch the shell defined in `shell.nix`.",
      "source_hash": 12665144203754719639,
      "context_hash": 7832599649157769732,
      "translation": "다음번에 터미널을 실행하여 프로젝트의 최상위 디렉터리에 진입하면, `direnv`가 `shell.nix`에 정의된 셸을 자동으로 실행합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T15:16:43.636683Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:10/seg:0",
      "source": "`direnv` will also check for changes to the `shell.nix` file.",
      "source_hash": 2635657697208828675,
      "context_hash": 9557481296228026295,
      "translation": "`direnv`는 `shell.nix` 파일의 변경 사항도 확인합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T15:16:43.636683Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:11/seg:0",
      "source": "Make the following addition:",
      "source_hash": 2239854959950549790,
      "context_hash": 18151765218405546926,
      "translation": "다음 내용을 추가하십시오:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T15:16:43.636683Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:13/seg:0",
      "source": "The running environment should reload itself after the first interaction (run any command or press `Enter`).",
      "source_hash": 11291478021613407661,
      "context_hash": 8112821593236166948,
      "translation": "실행 중인 환경은 첫 번째 상호작용(아무 명령이나 실행하거나 `Enter`를 누름) 이후 스스로 다시 로드되어야 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T15:16:43.636684Z",
      "issues": []
    }
  ]
}